sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Dish as Dish
    participant EventBus
    Client->>+Dish: changeRecipe(recipeId)
    Note over Dish: Policies: dishRead, dishWrite, dishExecute
    Note over Dish: Guards (3)
    Dish->>Dish: guard[0]: self.status == #quot;active#quot;
    Dish->>Dish: guard[1]: self.deletedAt == null
    Dish->>Dish: guard[2]: roleAllows(user.role, #quot;kitchenManageAccess#quot;)
    Dish->>Dish: compute.previousRecipeId
    Dish->>Dish: mutate.recipeId
    Dish->>EventBus: emit DishRecipeChanged on dish.recipe_changed
    Dish-->>-Client: void